// Candidate native map leaf: RAX map offset, R8 key offset, R9 payload,
// RDI mode (0 has,1 get,2 set), RSI result optional tag. Caller validates
// exact map/key tags, membership and set payload. Immutable strings and
// typed map writes are the only sources of entry keys/values. Stored key
// membership checked before byte comparison. Map count 129 pairs:
// length/ready then 64 key/ready and payload/ready pairs. No dynamic growth.
// Get allocates immutable optional after capacity check, publishing last.
// RAX result, RDX status. RBX/RBP/R12/R14/R15 preserved; R13 advances on get.
// Single-threaded live arena only. Private 178-byte guard follows leaf.
